  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A minor version for the rest of the WCAG 2.2 AA audit: what a palette colour paints as a fill or as a line. Text on a filled colour now reads at 4.5:1 in every variant, where MudBlazor's white fell to 1.93:1; a checked box, a switch, a slider, a focused underline and every other line or glyph in a colour reaches the 3:1 non-text contrast it needs; and a colour's text keeps 4.5:1 under the pointer too.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/627f4fe9b8fb841af87df805c7d31680991eaf80/docs/versions/1.2.0.md",
